  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">What is the <em>y</em>-coordinate of the <em>y</em>-intercept of the graph of <math alttext=\"StartFraction 3 x Over 7 EndFraction equals minus StartFraction 5 y Over 9 EndFraction plus 21\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mfrac>\n\t\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t\t<mn>3</mn>\n\t\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>7</mn>\n\t\t</mfrac>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t\t<mfrac>\n\t\t\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t\t\t<mn>5</mn>\n\t\t\t\t\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t\t\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t\t\t<mn>9</mn>\n\t\t\t</mfrac>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mn>21</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math> in the <em>xy</em>-plane?</p>",
